Package: BJMdeep
Title: Neural (DeepSurv) Survival Sub-Models for the Backward Joint Model
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person("Wenhao", "Li", email = "wenhaoli.jlu@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Experimental extension of the 'BJM' package. Fits the marginal
    survival sub-model of the backward joint model as a proportional hazards
    model whose log relative hazard is a neural network of the baseline
    covariates (DeepSurv; Katzman et al., 2018), and returns it in the form
    'BJM' expects, so dynamic prediction works unchanged. Implemented in base
    R, without a deep-learning library.
